  "details": "I would like the ability to prioritize drops at least people who currently do not have VRC+. Potentially other priorities can be built in or selectable, such as combining to prioritize friends or friends of friends or specific ranks, or any others that are appropriate.\n\nCurrently the only options for VRC+ Gift Drops are \"Random\" or \"Proximity\". Random appears to be completely random and so can easily gift people who have VRC+ already while users who do not are left out. Proximity only helps with enough coordination to get non-plus people close and keep greedy or curious subscribers away.\n\nThis benefits gifters to be able to have the most positive impact and can benefit VRC if the gifted folk continue the subscription directly.",
